      "description": "Come Along on the New Kids Krew Adventure! \n\nCalling all little adventurers – get ready for an afternoon of fun with The Kids Krew!\nJoin us for a FREE community event at the Regional Fire Museum in Downtown Aurora.\nEnjoy a rescue-themed adventure with exciting activities for the whole family.\nCreate a fun craft, explore the museum, enjoy hands-on activities, and stop by for a special character meet-and-greet.\nRegistration is required – register here>>\nWe can’t wait to see you there for a day of fun, creativity, and adventure!\n\nRegistration is required for the Kids Krew Pawsome Rescue Adventure. While supplies last.\nAurora Downtown District – where culture, creativity, and cuisine collide! From globally inspired cuisine and one-of-a-kind shops to live entertainment and inspiring public art, downtown Aurora is designed to be experienced. Just 45 minutes from Chicago, our downtown business district offers an urban vibe that’s bold, creative, and unmistakably Aurora. Welcome to Illinois’ second-largest city with a small-town feel!",
